- Hi, everyone.

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:19.620
I know I've been gone for
a while, but I'm back.

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:22.620
And I just wanna say thank
you for watching this episode.

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:25.626
